---
title: "FIG. 4 — Hybrid Source Arbitration State Machine"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNICAST_ONLY

    UNICAST_ONLY: State 401<br/>Rendering unicast media<br/>Initiate multicast join
    JOINING: State 402<br/>Unicast rendering continues<br/>Multicast packets buffered<br/>Repair injection active
    MULTICAST_PRIMARY: State 403<br/>Multicast is primary source<br/>Unicast suppressed<br/>Monitor reception quality
    FAILING_BACK: State 404<br/>Re-subscribe unicast<br/>LatestGroup delivery pref
    MULTICAST_STALLED: State 405<br/>High loss rate<br/>FEC recovery attempted<br/>Unicast fallback prepared

    UNICAST_ONLY --> JOINING: Multicast join initiated
    JOINING --> MULTICAST_PRIMARY: Video keyframe received\nvia multicast (402a)
    JOINING --> UNICAST_ONLY: Join timeout expired
    MULTICAST_PRIMARY --> MULTICAST_STALLED: Loss detected\nbut not sustained
    MULTICAST_PRIMARY --> FAILING_BACK: Sustained loss\nexceeds threshold (403a)
    MULTICAST_STALLED --> MULTICAST_PRIMARY: Loss clears\n(hysteresis)
    MULTICAST_STALLED --> FAILING_BACK: Loss persists
    FAILING_BACK --> UNICAST_ONLY: Unicast data arrives

    note right of JOINING
        Step 402c: FEC repair symbols
        from unicast injected into
        multicast FEC blocks
    end note

    note right of JOINING
        Step 402b: Audio activates
        independently on separate timer
    end note
